WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.479 --> 00:00:06.550
Tap a bead to slide it over, with every bead before it.

2
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.568
Today’s task: show 13 across two rows.

3
00:00:09.568 --> 00:00:12.986
Turn on Cover. How many beads are hidden?

4
00:00:12.986 --> 00:00:14.804
Uncover to check.

5
00:00:14.804 --> 00:00:17.360
Switch to 20-bead rows to count to 20 on one row.

6
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.933
Drag the handle bar to move a rekenrek.

7
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:23.987
Hold it for its wheel. Copy makes a second one.

8
00:00:23.987 --> 00:00:26.982
Drag across empty space to select several at once.

9
00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:29.352
Drag one, and they all move together.

10
00:00:29.352 --> 00:00:31.547
Tap empty space to let go.

11
00:00:31.547 --> 00:00:39.717
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
